 r"I am writing to apply for the Graduate Finance Automation Analyst position at Zenith. I completed an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London in September 2026, where a distinction is expected, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I currently work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. Across my academic and professional experience I have spotted repetitive processes, automated them with code, and made sure the automated output could be trusted before people relied on it.",

